// Ch10: the child from C5, after the tide. Children count; the clutch does not.
title: ch10_bark_kirru_child_after
location: ch10/reedhollow
---
<<if $ch10_farewell_tide_seen>>
    Kirru_child as "Kirru child" [neutral]: They went up. So many. I counted. My mother says you do not count. I counted anyway. #line:ch10_bark_kchild_001
<<else>>
    Kirru_child as "Kirru child" [neutral]: Tonight is the tide. You will see. You will have to turn around, though. #line:ch10_bark_kchild_002
<<endif>>
===
